                "entry_id": "cf611b0e-4b07-32fe-be0a-6ad23417b5c8",
                "word": "pacifisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c43e316d-b141-3b0a-8e58-452f44a744b2",
                        "entry_id": "cf611b0e-4b07-32fe-be0a-6ad23417b5c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een wereldbeschouwing die duurzame vrede nastreeft en tegen oorlog en geweld is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0536c206-9023-4169-b090-d390b48d62cb",
                                "sense_id": "c43e316d-b141-3b0a-8e58-452f44a744b2",
                                "text": "‘De berichten over de brandhaarden in Berkeley kwamen heel snel binnen en Amerika interesseerde ons bijzonder. Het militarisme van de Verenigde Staten in Vietnam lokte veel protest uit. Een nieuw type pacifisme begon zich te manifesteren. In Berlijn wilden studenten een nieuw soort oppositie, en niet volgens het parlementaire systeem. Je had geen Facebook nodig om dat proces zich te zien verspreiden.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92937af9-07bd-4776-9ab0-6dc4fc746b42",
                                "sense_id": "c43e316d-b141-3b0a-8e58-452f44a744b2",
                                "text": "De musical vertelt het verhaal van de provinciaal Claude, die naar New York afreist om zijn dienstplicht te vervullen, lees: te sneuvelen in Vietnam. In de grote stad loopt hij de hippies tegen het lijf, kolkend van rebellie, vrijheidsdrang, pacifisme en navelstaarderij, die hem de Age of Aquarius binnenvoeren."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "71e394d0-6dad-4eb1-b263-3b268c1028a6",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf611b0e-4b07-32fe-be0a-6ad23417b5c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "c43e316d-b141-3b0a-8e58-452f44a744b2",
                        "source_sense_description": "een wereldbeschouwing die duurzame vrede nastreeft en tegen oorlog en geweld is",
                        "target_lang_word": "pacifism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pacifism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea6f57ee-c60d-315c-9baa-a2ff7a2aeecf",
                                        "entry_id": "4d393c1b-307f-386c-ba3a-11057f5d8b5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The support of peace, specifically:",
                                            "The conviction that it is morally wrong to settle disputes (especially between countries) by war or other violent means."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2d5e573-77bf-4494-a334-26ab1169f9d3",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6f57ee-c60d-315c-9baa-a2ff7a2aeecf",
                                                "text": "I am not only a pacifist but a militant pacifist. I am willing to fight for peace. Nothing will end war unless the people themselves refuse to go to war."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "375068b4-2c02-4697-a88d-430e00fd1c16",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6f57ee-c60d-315c-9baa-a2ff7a2aeecf",
                                                "text": "The individual pacifist (who may or may not follow a particular religion) can for example support voluntary euthanasia while at the same time retaining a consistent view about how to approach issues surrounding violent conflict and the common good. Although such issues raise complex ethical dilemmas, for some, pacifism can accomodate^([sic]) the possibility of killing in certain circumstances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae963eaa-4ff3-32c9-ad77-1788fad8087d",
                                        "entry_id": "4d393c1b-307f-386c-ba3a-11057f5d8b5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The support of peace, specifically:",
                                            "The ethical avoidance of inflicting harm on others in one's daily life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "448f19f5-4985-44ed-8dc8-bbddb221f85c",
                                                "sense_id": "ae963eaa-4ff3-32c9-ad77-1788fad8087d",
                                                "text": "Pacifism forbids us from killing would-be murderers in self-defense, but terrorism permits us to slit the throat of a 17-year-old working a night shift at the zoo.[…]Pacifism also has the modal implication that no possible wrongful aggressor can be permissibly harmed, even in possible worlds where doing so is the only feasible means of saving oneself or others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3ca01c9-04b5-30de-aa0e-933a27db58f9",
                                        "entry_id": "4d393c1b-307f-386c-ba3a-11057f5d8b5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The support of peace, specifically:",
                                            "The combination of the above two philosophical viewpoints."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92cf161f-8be7-364c-92eb-6c64d1f7db8d",
                                        "entry_id": "4d393c1b-307f-386c-ba3a-11057f5d8b5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The additional challenge of winning a game without harming any enemy characters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
